                "text": "The duergar unleashes a string of insults laced with subtle enchantments at a creature they can see within 60 feet. If the creature can hear them (it doesn't need to understand them), it must succeed on a DC 12 Wisdom saving throw or take 1d4 psychic damage and have disadvantage on the next attack roll it makes before the end of its next turn.",
